Take a squadron on a mission to free up the 6th battalion. Karnov believes that the Black Dogs will retreat to their outpost if it is threatened. You must eliminate the Black Dog Recycler and then escape before they cut off your retreat.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Destroy the Black Dog Recycler.
- Avoid detection while en-route to the outpost.
- Return to our base.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
You will be piloting a Grendel bomber. You will have four additional Grendel bombers at your command.